  "description": "Nix evaluation, build and substitution activity from Determinate Nix OpenTelemetry traces, aggregated by the collector's spanmetrics connector (traces_span_metrics_*). Counts are exact: export is enabled for the daemon and comin, and no sampler drops spans. Panels distinguish client spans (nix/nixos-rebuild, where evaluation happens) from daemon spans (builds, substitutions, transfers).",
